ystem, which received the most comments.This update brings a full rework of the weapon system while keeping the core mining fun intact. We’ve also added new content, new mechanics, new maps, and visual improvements. We hope all of this brings you something excit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-03T07:16:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366169353","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3552660-1799817379542918","game_id":"steam-3552660","kind":"update","title":"🎮 Claw & Load Demo – New Update Is Ready!","summary":"Hey Miners and Meowling Commanders! The Claw & Load demo is getting an update! We've fixed bugs, added fresh content, and made improvements across the board — from smoother controls and better maps to a new boss, UI tweaks, and even a long-awaited tutorial and challenge mode. ✅ What's New in This Update Character Control Improvements Increased base movement speed and acceleration Added new movement-speed-related upgrade options Buffed existing movement-related upgrades Magnet Item Rework Removed","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-05-17T20:25:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1799817379542918","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3552660-1799088287875277","game_id":"steam-3552660","kind":"announcement","title":"CLAW & LOAD: We've Heard You! Optimizations Incoming!","summary":"Hello everyone! Since the Demo went live, we've received a ton of enthusiastic feedback and suggestions from all of you players. We're truly grateful for your support and attention! Whether it's about gameplay mechanics, control feel, map structure, or bug reports – we've carefully recorded everything, discussed it internally, and have already started making adjustments. Currently, the areas we are focusing on optimizing include: Character movement and control feel The pick-up experience for the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-05-09T20:10:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1799088287875277","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3552660-1798454487700243","game_id":"steam-3552660","kind":"announcement","title":"Try the Demo Now!","summary":"🚀 Our Demo is Now Live on Steam! 🚀 Hi everyone! We’re thrilled to announce that the demo for our game is officially available! You can now experience the exciting combination of mining, shooting, and surviving — alongside our mischievous cat companion! 🐾 👉 Play the Demo Here! What’s New Compared to the Playtest: Level Design Early-game pacing has been significantly adjusted. The first half of Canyon of the Dead has been completely reworked, with clearer stage transitions focused on the mining ph","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-05-04T13:13:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1798454487700243","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3552660-1795283637845974","game_id":"steam-3552660","kind":"announcement","title":"🌟 PLAYTEST ANNOUNCEMENT: CLAW & LOAD - MINE, SHOOT, MEOW! 🌟","summary":"Greetings, Miners! Claw & Load is officially launching its FIRST playtest! Dive into smoother combat, wilder builds, and pure cat-powered chaos—all polished to a diamond-tier shine. Your feedback will shape the future of this claw-swinging, loot-hoarding, meow-gical adventure! 🔧 Play Test Details Exclusive Access: Limited slots for our most dedicated miners! New Nightmare Fuel: Battle twisted monsters & serve your tsundere cat overlord in the Eternal Night Continent. Shape the Game: Your feedbac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-28T08:38:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1795283637845974","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3552660-1794102528104440","game_id":"steam-3552660","kind":"announcement","title":"🌟 Claw & Load – Wishlist Meow! 🌟","summary":"Hey Miners & Cat Enthusiasts! The shadows of the Eternal Night Continent are stirring—and so is its tsundere ruler! Claw & Load, a chaotic roguelite shooter where magic meets gun mining, is officially announced. Serve the Demon Cat Queen (who’s totally not obsessed with mushrooms, we swear), blast through procedurally generated hellscapes, and command an army of weapon-wielding Guardian Mewlings! Why Wishlist? 🔸 Dig or Die – Mine resources, fight undead hordes, and risk it all in dynamic climate","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-14T10:46:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1794102528104440","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3552660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:09Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3552660":"2026-10-26T10:39:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3552660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:09Z"},"3687820":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:10Z"}},